{"sentence_id": "hb-c08-u0160-s004", "text": "Genom självständiga studier kan man avlägga till exempel en yrkesexamen eller delar av en examen.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c08-vuxna/narration/resume-20261103T060454585830+0000-8/hb-c08-u0160-s004.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 8.846802721088435, "peak": 0.27520751953125, "generation_seconds": 29.45749285304919, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c08-u0161-s001", "text": "Yrkesutbildningar är grundexamen, yrkesexamen och specialyrkesexamen.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c08-vuxna/narration/resume-20261103T060454585830+0000-8/hb-c08-u0161-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 6.130068027210885, "peak": 0.283294677734375, "generation_seconds": 22.246645255945623, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c08-u0161-s002", "text": "Yrkesinriktad grundexamen kan avläggas av både unga och vuxna.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c08-vuxna/narration/resume-20261103T060454585830+0000-8/hb-c08-u0161-s002.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 5.7817687074829935, "peak": 0.271148681640625, "generation_seconds": 24.178680973825976, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c08-u0161-s003", "text": "Den är avsedd för personer som inte har tidigare kunskaper i yrket i fråga.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c08-vuxna/narration/resume-20261103T060454585830+0000-8/hb-c08-u0161-s003.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 6.617687074829932, "peak": 0.27685546875, "generation_seconds": 28.81754320510663, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c08-u0161-s004", "text": "Examen avläggs vid en läroanstalt eller som en läroavtalsutbildning.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c08-vuxna/narration/resume-20261103T060454585830+0000-8/hb-c08-u0161-s004.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 6.2693877551020405, "peak": 0.30816650390625, "generation_seconds": 20.78795990301296, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c08-u0162-s001", "text": "I vissa situationer kan studierna vid dessa läroanstalter dock vara kostnadsfria.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c08-vuxna/narration/resume-20261103T060454585830+0000-8/hb-c08-u0162-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 7.523265306122449, "peak": 0.289764404296875, "generation_seconds": 23.96628101100214, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c08-u0162-s002", "text": "Om till exempel utbildning i läs- och skrivkunnighet eller någon annan språkutbildning har godkänts till din integrationsplan, tas det inte ut någon avgift för studierna.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c08-vuxna/narration/resume-20261103T060454585830+0000-8/hb-c08-u0162-s002.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 14.140952380952381, "peak": 0.28326416015625, "generation_seconds": 52.73191663902253, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
